    "intro_html":  "This is the pot roast for the first cold week of the year. Apple juice stands in for cider, Dijon and tomato paste keep it from going sweet, and the carrots and potatoes cook in the same liquid until they taste like the roast. It is a full dinner in one vessel with no separate starch to make. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and {{cal}} calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
